OL,3,AStorm Austen to bring severe gales to
OL,4,AUK as weather warning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Storm Austen will move away later
OL,7,Fon Friday, another deep area of low
OL,8,Fpressure will bring more wet and windy
OL,9,Fweather on Saturday.
